  "details": "eg\nusr_fcb12ede-0233-4ec2-9f3f-9fd7995cbfc0\n\nSuch bots could trigger anything in a instance and use every feature of the api. Pretty sure thats one of the tools maliscious people use other from compromised accounts by using leaked pws, cuz a member of a modding group in a instance once said \"I can get everybody banned\". And i think reports from random bot accounts, blocks, mutes and such could do harm to said \"everybody\". Additional to them having access to all the games features in the worlds, everything normal clients can do is possible as well, ranging from crashing people with specific avatars, sound trolling and more. As a software developer i know of all the harm one could do via automation all stuff in a game and latter really has no place in vrchat. As if the normal client users werent enough with triggering everything, bots could *actually* do everything. Blocked? Send 2 more bots! This shouldnt happen to people in vrchat.",
